    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441630/extras/fa733ffae07aff08a4335ff32390d763.poster.avif?t=1743349096\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441630/extras/fa733ffae07aff08a4335ff32390d763.webm?t=1743349096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441630/extras/fa733ffae07aff08a4335ff32390d763.mp4?t=1743349096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE WASTE</strong> \u2013 a brutal and stylish action game about bloody street shootouts and survival in a city after a global collapse, where authority has fallen, and crime thrives. Two factions fight for control over the city, its resources, and survivors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Criminal Chaos and the Struggle for Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441630/extras/aee564040ac455e26ab554f9b25ca871.poster.avif?t=1743349096\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441630/extras/aee564040ac455e26ab554f9b25ca871.webm?t=1743349096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441630/extras/aee564040ac455e26ab554f9b25ca871.mp4?t=1743349096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Nova-City</strong> \u2013 a metropolis where the law no longer matters. Here, everyone is on their own, and only strength, cunning, and good weapons will help you survive. <strong>Money, reputation, and the right to stay alive</strong> \u2013 you will have to earn them or take them by force.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf06 A City That Lives by Its Own Rules</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441630/extras/6dd0c00e3615b6a54e041ea66edceb7c.poster.avif?t=1743349096\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441630/extras/6dd0c00e3615b6a54e041ea66edceb7c.webm?t=1743349096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441630/extras/6dd0c00e3615b6a54e041ea66edceb7c.mp4?t=1743349096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Nova-City: <strong>from gang-infested slums to elite skyscrapers where dark deals take place</strong>. There are <strong>no heroes here</strong> \u2013 only predators and prey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd2b Realistic Combat System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Explosive gameplay</strong> with dynamic, lifelike shooting<br>\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Realistic ballistics</strong> and impactful weapon recoil<br>\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Brutal shootouts</strong> with a high level of violence</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441630/extras/51e0cbcaab387309db8625f6ef70f794.poster.avif?t=1743349096\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441630/extras/51e0cbcaab387309db8625f6ef70f794.webm?t=1743349096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441630/extras/51e0cbcaab387309db8625f6ef70f794.mp4?t=1743349096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc65 The Choice is Yours</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Play <strong>solo or in co-op</strong><br>\ud83d\udd39 Develop your <strong>reputation and playstyle</strong><br>\ud83d\udd39 Gather gear and <strong>upgrade your arsenal</strong><br>\ud83d\udd39 Earn, survive, and find your own path</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 THE WASTE is...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>An immersive shooter</strong> with a deep atmosphere<br>\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Hardcore gameplay</strong> with no compromises<br>\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Style, blood, concrete, and crime</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u26a1 Your journey starts here. Are you ready to survive?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Add to your wishlist and be among the first to dive into the game!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441630/extras/fa733ffae07aff08a4335ff32390d763.poster.avif?t=1743349096\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441630/extras/fa733ffae07aff08a4335ff32390d763.webm?t=1743349096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441630/extras/fa733ffae07aff08a4335ff32390d763.mp4?t=1743349096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE WASTE</strong> \u2013 a brutal and stylish action game about bloody street shootouts and survival in a city after a global collapse, where authority has fallen, and crime thrives. Two factions fight for control over the city, its resources, and survivors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Criminal Chaos and the Struggle for Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441630/extras/aee564040ac455e26ab554f9b25ca871.poster.avif?t=1743349096\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441630/extras/aee564040ac455e26ab554f9b25ca871.webm?t=1743349096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441630/extras/aee564040ac455e26ab554f9b25ca871.mp4?t=1743349096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Nova-City</strong> \u2013 a metropolis where the law no longer matters. Here, everyone is on their own, and only strength, cunning, and good weapons will help you survive. <strong>Money, reputation, and the right to stay alive</strong> \u2013 you will have to earn them or take them by force.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf06 A City That Lives by Its Own Rules</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441630/extras/6dd0c00e3615b6a54e041ea66edceb7c.poster.avif?t=1743349096\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441630/extras/6dd0c00e3615b6a54e041ea66edceb7c.webm?t=1743349096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441630/extras/6dd0c00e3615b6a54e041ea66edceb7c.mp4?t=1743349096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Nova-City: <strong>from gang-infested slums to elite skyscrapers where dark deals take place</strong>. There are <strong>no heroes here</strong> \u2013 only predators and prey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd2b Realistic Combat System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Explosive gameplay</strong> with dynamic, lifelike shooting<br>\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Realistic ballistics</strong> and impactful weapon recoil<br>\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Brutal shootouts</strong> with a high level of violence</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441630/extras/51e0cbcaab387309db8625f6ef70f794.poster.avif?t=1743349096\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441630/extras/51e0cbcaab387309db8625f6ef70f794.webm?t=1743349096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441630/extras/51e0cbcaab387309db8625f6ef70f794.mp4?t=1743349096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc65 The Choice is Yours</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Play <strong>solo or in co-op</strong><br>\ud83d\udd39 Develop your <strong>reputation and playstyle</strong><br>\ud83d\udd39 Gather gear and <strong>upgrade your arsenal</strong><br>\ud83d\udd39 Earn, survive, and find your own path</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 THE WASTE is...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>An immersive shooter</strong> with a deep atmosphere<br>\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Hardcore gameplay</strong> with no compromises<br>\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Style, blood, concrete, and crime</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u26a1 Your journey starts here. Are you ready to survive?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Add to your wishlist and be among the first to dive into the game!</strong></p>",
